    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The bird stole the baby from the panda.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >She needs help to get it back.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Run after the bird and collect crystals.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Buy weapons and bonuses.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Jump to collect crystals and dodge enemies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Controls:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Jump - space</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >High jump: - space during a jump</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >By purchasing the game you will receive:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- a dynamic runner where you need to run, jump and dodge, chasing the kidnapping bird.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- the ability to collect crystals to improve the character and buy weapons / bonuses.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- use of various weapons and bonuses.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In general, you will get a fun, dynamic and emotionally engaging game in the runner genre with elements of customization and pumping.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The bird stole the baby from the panda.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >She needs help to get it back.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Run after the bird and collect crystals.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Buy weapons and bonuses.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Jump to collect crystals and dodge enemies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Controls:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Jump - space</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >High jump: - space during a jump</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >By purchasing the game you will receive:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- a dynamic runner where you need to run, jump and dodge, chasing the kidnapping bird.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- the ability to collect crystals to improve the character and buy weapons / bonuses.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- use of various weapons and bonuses.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In general, you will get a fun, dynamic and emotionally engaging game in the runner genre with elements of customization and pumping.</p>",
